@startuml
title Viewing equipment history
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant ":LabLog" as App
participant ":HistoryCommands" as History
participant ":Inventory" as Inventory
participant ":LoanBook" as Loans
participant "otherHistory:Supplier" as Source

[-> App : history OSC-001
activate App
App -> History : execute(input)
activate History
note right of History : Validate command syntax
History -> Inventory : getEquipmentUnits()
activate Inventory
Inventory --> History : equipment units
deactivate Inventory
note right of History : Find equipment with the exact asset ID;\nreject unknown equipment before collecting history
History -> History : getHistory(assetId)
activate History
History -> Loans : getLoans()
activate Loans
Loans --> History : active and returned loans
deactivate Loans
loop Each loan matching the asset ID
    note right of History : Create a HistoryEntry using the loan date\nand current loan details, including any return
end
History -> Source : get()
activate Source
Source --> History : additional history entries
deactivate Source
note right of History
Include additional entries matching the asset ID.
Sort by date, then type, then description.
end note
History --> History : sorted entries
deactivate History
alt No matching entries
    History --> App : empty-history message
else Matching entries exist
    History --> App : formatted history and record count
end
deactivate History
App -->[ : display result
deactivate App
legend bottom
Registered-equipment path shown; individual accessor calls are omitted.
The supplier combines caller-supplied entries with session history notes.
Viewing history does not mutate records or trigger a save.
endlegend
@enduml
